## API Endpoints Summary

### Base URL
`/api/business-processes`

### Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Query Params |
|--------|----------|-------------|--------------|
| GET | `/api/business-processes` | List all processes | `?tier=`, `?criticality=`, `?owner=` |
| GET | `/api/business-processes/:id` | Get single process | - |
| GET | `/api/business-processes/summary` | Get org stats | - |
| POST | `/api/business-processes` | Create process | - |
| PUT | `/api/business-processes/:id` | Update process | - |
| PUT | `/api/business-processes/:id/systems` | Map systems | - |
| PUT | `/api/business-processes/:id/data-objects` | Map data objects | - |
| PUT | `/api/business-processes/:id/controls` | Map controls | - |
| DELETE | `/api/business-processes/:id` | Delete process | - |

### Response Format

**List Response:**
```json
{
  "organizationId": "org-123",
  "count": 10,
  "filters": { "tier": "Primary" },
  "data": [
    {
      "id": "bp_claims_payment_ops",
      "name": "Claims & Payment Operations",
      "tier": "Primary",
      "criticality": "Critical",
      "owner": "CIO",
      "description": "...",
      "organizationId": "org-123",
      "supportedBySystems": ["sys-1"],
      "createsDataObjects": ["data-1"],
      "governedByControls": ["ctrl-1"],
      "healthScore": 85,
      "controlCoverage": 80,
      "controlGap": 2,
      "assetCount": 1,
      "riskCount": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-06-11T00:00:00Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-11T00:00:00Z"
    }
  ]
}
```

**Summary Response:**
```json
{
  "organizationId": "org-123",
  "total": 10,
  "byTier": { "Primary": 7, "Strategic":": 3 },
  "byCriticality": { "Critical": 5, "High": 3, "Medium": 1, "Low": 1 },
  "byOwner": { "CIO": 6, "CISO": 2, "CFO": 2 },
  "averageHealthScore": 79,
  "averageControlCoverage": 76,
  "processesNeedingAttention": 2
}
```

